diff --git a/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md b/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
index d5fc22849..827e89182 100644
--- a/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
+++ b/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
@@ -313,7 +313,7 @@ Note: New panels added or modified mostly not mentioned here for concision. See
 - Sevopedia — Improvements: Added a new sortable **Improvement Weights (Leaders) Chart**, showing **Weights**, **Count** per Weight, and **clickable Leader buttons** for each weight and improvement.
 - Sevopedia — Terrain: add new **Peak** add **Hill** entries (they were previously hidden in Base AdvCiv). Even though they technically are plot types, adding them helps show some information specific to these "terrains".
 - Sevopedia — Civilizations: Add **cities panel**. Add optional **grouping by Art style** (e.g. European, Asian).
-- Sevopedia — Leaders: New **AI Personality panel** with raw attributes and cross-leader comparisons, and optional **grouping by civilization (with an icon)**. See also [SevoPediaLeaderAIPValues.py](/Assets/Python/Contrib/Sevopedia/SevoPediaLeaderAIPValues.py). Beautify **Traits with icon characters**. Make a free promotion's UnitCombats span **in the same line** instead of taking too much vertical space, and **add a blank line between Traits** for readability. Also **add linking** to their **corresponding Sevopedia Traits entry**: change in [CvGameTextMgr.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvGameTextMgr.cpp). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5502+) Add **Attitude** (furious, annoyed, cautious, pleased, friendly) and **Action buttons** (noanim/idle, greeting, agree, disagree). On click, the animation changes its behaviour to that of the buttons clicked. See also: [How to read the AI Personality panel](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_AI_Personality_Panel.md#displaying-the-ai-attributes-in-the-ai-personality-panel-and-how-to-read-the-tablespanels). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5512+) Make **item bar shorter** with a **per font size tunable width** to accommodate the **AI Personality panel wider columns when text is upscaled**.
+- Sevopedia — Leaders: New **AI Personality panel** with raw attributes and cross-leader comparisons, and optional **grouping by civilization (with an icon)**. See also [SevoPediaLeaderAIPValues.py](/Assets/Python/Contrib/Sevopedia/SevoPediaLeaderAIPValues.py). Beautify **Traits with icon characters**. Make a free promotion's UnitCombats span **in the same line** instead of taking too much vertical space, and **add a blank line between Traits** for readability. Also **add linking** to their **corresponding Sevopedia Traits entry**: change in [CvGameTextMgr.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvGameTextMgr.cpp). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5502+) Add **Attitude** (furious, annoyed, cautious, pleased, friendly) and **Action buttons** (noanim/idle, greeting, agree, disagree). On click, the animation changes its behaviour to that of the buttons clicked. See also: [How to read the AI Personality panel](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_AI_Personality_Panel.md#displaying-the-ai-attributes-in-the-ai-personality-panel-and-how-to-read-the-tablespanels). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5512+) Make **item bar shorter** with a **per font size tunable width** to accommodate the **AI Personality panel wider columns when text is upscaled**. Note: this applied **only for lower resolutions**, because higher resolutions have enough width to accomodate an enlarged AI Personality Panel when text is upscaled, so there is no need to reduce item bar width in Sevopedia Leader to accomodate it.
 - Sevopedia — Concepts (`ConceptInfos`) (placed under the "Outdated" *Sevopedia category*): added reference entries — e.g. `concept_rivers`, `concept_global_warming`, `concept_customization`. **"Outdated" is a Sevopedia category label** we use for pages **not maintained** to match AdvCiv-SAS rules; these exist for general Civ4 background and UI reuse. See: [Concepts (Outdated)](/README.md#concepts-as-of-now-in-the-outdated-sevopedia-category).
 - Sevopedia — Mods Infos (`NewConceptInfos`): Added **Mods Infos** (e.g., K-Mod, AdvCiv, AdvCiv-SAS). Added **Legend items** showing the legend (e.g., for the Info Screen's new Score Tab; for the Sevopedia Leader's AI Personality Panel, (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5509+) Sevopedia Categories, abbreviation meaning (e.g., for numTxt `+50/-75` or `InC`; for the AI Personality Panel `T.W Likely -> getMaxWarRand` or `Build Unit % -> getBuildUnitProb`)), with `(Inverted)` information. See also: [README.md (Legends)](/README.md#legends).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5510+) Sevopedia — Corporations: **reworked** and **beautified** the page layout, with **new Competes With, Bonuses Consumed, Bonuses Generated, and Movie** panels. Exposed `getBonusProduced` to Python in [CvInfo_Organization.h](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvInfo_Organization.h), [CvInfo_Organization.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvInfo_Organization.cpp), and [CyInfoInterface3.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CyInfoInterface3.cpp) so the new generated-bonus panel is cleanly supported. See [Sevopedia reworks (Corporations)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-15-corporations-category).

